sequenceDiagram
    actor U as You
    participant D as desktop Factor
    participant R as rendezvous
    participant P as Puppy Factor
    U->>D: "Add another machine to the swarm"
    D->>R: open a pairing mailbox
    D-->>U: says the code "47 · 3829 1506"
    U->>P: gives it the code when it asks
    P->>R: claim mailbox 47
    D->>P: SPAKE2 through the mailbox
    Note over D,P: the rendezvous relays it but cannot read it or guess the code
    D->>P: envelope: swarm id, rendezvous, desktop key, proof of that key
    P->>D: envelope: Puppy key, its name, proof of that key
    D->>R: roster epoch n+1, signed by the desktop, committed
    R-->>P: new roster
    R-->>D: new roster
    D-->>U: "Puppy joined"
